{"kind": "mod", "id": 1505, "name": "Massivesoft Guns - Realism Compatibility Patch", "slug": "massivesoft-guns-realism-compatibility-patch", "teaser": "This adds SPT Realism compatibility for Massivesofts weapon mods, and the \"Massivesoft Weapon Bundle\" mod by RheddElBozo.", "owner_name": "Therkelsen", "downloads": 3909, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-13T18:04:57.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-06-25T19:47:26.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-06-25T19:47:26.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.9.0", "latest_version": "1.1.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<h2><strong>Info</strong></h2>\n<p>This is for <strong>SPT v3.9.X</strong> and either:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2171-massivesoft-weapon-bundle/#overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Massivesoft Weapon Bundle</a> v1.0.2</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Plus</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2364-dg-56-5-56x45-rifle/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">DG-56 5.56x45 Rifle</a> v1.0.0</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2288-iso-hemlock/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ISO Hemlock</a> v1.0.1</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2376-longbow-bolt-action-rifle/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Longbow</a> v1.0.0</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2336-mcw-rifle/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">MCW Rifle</a> v1.0.1</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2365-new-mags-from-mws/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">New Mags from MWs</a> v1.0.0</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Or all the standalone mods from Massivesoft:</p>\n<p>1. The ones mentioned above,</p>\n<p>2. And these ones, although they need to be updated first. It should work with them too, though.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1234-jak-12-automatic-shotgun/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">JAK-12 Automatic Shotgun</a> v1.3.1</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1162-m14-rifle/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">M14 Rifle</a> v1.2.0</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1235-m1911-centennial-edition/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">1911 Centennial Edition</a> v1.2.0</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1127-qbz-03-chinese-rifle-5-56x45-export-version/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">QBZ-03 Chinese Rifle 5.56x45 Export Version</a> v1.2.2</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2090-qbz-97-5-56x45-rifle/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">QBZ-97 5.56x45 Rifle</a> v1.0.2</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2012-iwi-tavor-x95-x95-r-rifle/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">IWI Tavor X95/X95-R Rifle</a> v1.0.1</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1136-chinese-type-64-silenced-submachine-gun/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Chinese Type 64 Silenced Submachine Gun</a> v1.2.0</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1160-kriss-vector-308-assault-rifle/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">KRISS Vector .308 Assault Rifle</a> v1.2.0</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you experience any issues, feel free to open an issue. If fixing it yourself is more your thing, there’s a guide on how to contribute on the GitHub repository. Shoutout to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/55363-optimuschad/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>OptimusChad</strong></a> who made <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2017-realism-compatibility-for-massivesoft-weapons/#versions\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>the patch</strong></a> for the original mods by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/user-file-list/18902-massivesoft/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Massivesoft</strong></a>. I’ve used their values for inspiration, in some places more than others.</p>\n<h2><strong>Dependencies</strong></h2>\n<p>Obviously, you’ll need <strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2171-massivesoft-weapon-bundle/#overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Massivesoft Weapon Bundle</a></strong> and <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/606-spt-realism-mod/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>SPT Realism</strong></a> for this to do anything. This would also work with Massivesofts original mods if they decide to update them all.</p>\n<h2><strong>Installation</strong></h2>\n<p>1. If you have a previous version installed, go delete the old folder at \\user\\mods\\SPT-Realism\\db\\put_new_stuff_here\\Massivesoft_Guns</p>\n<p>2. Download the latest release.</p>\n<p>3. Drop the provided user folder into your SPT folder.</p>\n<p>If the changes don’t load, you may want to also clear cache / temp files.</p>\n<p>1. In \\user\\cache, delete:</p>\n<p>bundleHashCache.json, jsonCache.json, and modCache.json</p>\n<p>But do NOT delete the folder named bundles.</p>\n<p>2. In the SPT launcher, clear temp files:</p>\n<p>Open launcher &gt; Click settings &gt; Click clean temp files</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.3", "content_length": null, "downloads": 201, "published_at": "2024-06-25T19:47:26.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1505/massivesoft-guns-realism-compatibility-patch/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.3", "content_length": null, "downloads": 251, "published_at": "2024-06-26T20:29:08.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1505/massivesoft-guns-realism-compatibility-patch/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.3", "content_length": null, "downloads": 269, "published_at": "2024-06-29T01:38:53.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1505/massivesoft-guns-realism-compatibility-patch/1.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.3", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.3", "content_length": null, "downloads": 267, "published_at": "2024-07-03T17:53:24.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1505/massivesoft-guns-realism-compatibility-patch/1.0.3", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.4", "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 255, "published_at": "2024-07-07T19:42:14.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1505/massivesoft-guns-realism-compatibility-patch/1.0.4", "github_url": null